@WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205
@eventId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@adminToken = dev-token

### Get event by slug
GET {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/nasze-wesele
Accept: application/json

###

### Get photos for an event
GET {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/photos/event/{{eventId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Download all photos for an event as a zip
GET {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/photos/event/{{eventId}}/download

###

### Upload photos (multipart/form-data)
POST {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/photos/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WeddingGalleryBoundary

------WeddingGalleryBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="eventId"

{{eventId}}
------WeddingGalleryBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploaderName"

Test Guest
------WeddingGalleryBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------WeddingGalleryBoundary--

###

### Admin login
POST {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### Admin: create event
POST {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Kasia i Krzys"
}

###

### Admin: delete photo
DELETE {{WeddingGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/photos/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###